#: ../../getting_started/functionality/communication.rst:7
msgid "Communication Frequency and Configurability"
msgstr "Frecuencia de comunicación y configurabilidad"

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/communication.rst:9
msgid ""
"The following table describes communication categories, frequency, and "
"configurability between |morpheus| and integrated technologies. The named"
" check rows describe network behavior that may be used by monitoring "
"checks; they are not an inventory of currently shipped Instance Types, "
"Layouts, or automatically created checks. Confirm the check types "
"available in the current release under :menuselection:`Monitoring --> "
"Checks --> + Add` before using a row for deployment planning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/communication.rst:11
msgid ""
"Older service-specific Instance Types and Layouts were disabled beginning"
" with |morpheus| 6.0. Existing workloads may still retain those records. "
"A communication row is therefore not evidence that a corresponding system"
" Instance Type is available for new provisioning."
msgstr ""

