#: ../../getting_started/functionality/communication.rst:593
msgid ""
"The following table contains communication port and protocol data between"
" |morpheus| appliance tiers, managed machines, and services. All "
"communication to and from |morpheus| goes thru the application tier with "
"exception of inter-cluster communications for each of the |morpheus| "
"tiers when using a distributed architecture."
msgstr ""
"La siguiente tabla contiene datos de puertos de comunicación y protocolos"
" entre |morpheus| niveles del appliance, máquinas gestionadas y "
"servicios. Toda la comunicación hacia y desde |morpheus| pasa a través "
"del nivel de aplicación con exception of inter-cluster communications for"
" cada of the |morpheus| tiers al usar a distributed architecture."

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/communication.rst:595
msgid ""
"Ports used to communicate with integrated technologies are those defined "
"for the integration’s API. They are not represented in this table as many"
" of these are configurable and may be different in each customer "
"environment. Additionally, ports used to complete Morpheus checks are "
"customizable and may vary for each check configured. They are also not "
"represented in this table."
msgstr ""
"Ports used to communicate con integrated technologies are those defined "
"for the integration’s API. They are no represented in this table as "
"muchos of these are configurable y puede ser diferente in cada customer "
"environment. Adicionalmente, ports used to complete Morpheus checks are "
"customizable y may vary for cada check configured. They are también no "
"represented in this table."

